[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the\nramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in OFF\nposition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428180\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429261\">4450B12</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429151\">3310A32</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the front brake caliper brackets\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044701.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Unscrew the bolts (1a) and remove the front brake discs (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044702.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Refit the front brake discs (1a) in their seatings and tighten\nthe bolts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Pin</p></td><td><p>FRONT BRAKE DISC.</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Wheel hub side) 1.0 ÷ 1.4</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044703.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Place the front brake caliper brackets (1a) back in their housings\nand fix them tightening the bolts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT BRAKE CALIPER BRACKET</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Stub axle side) 10.0 ÷ 11.0</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044704.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429151\">3310A32</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428829\">0010T64</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428830\">0010T65</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429261\">4450B12</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]